From a7e519d7a69ba5f455a20814aa3e8466d8e1fb46 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: JohnSnow <110465696+JohnSnow14284@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 2 Aug 2026 22:04:13 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 18/23] Add remote contraption pose sync & rendering tweaks

Introduce remote contraption pose sampling and client-side interpolation for Create contraptions, including a new ContraptionPose/ContraptionPosesPayload protocol and server-side sampling in CreateTrainSampler. Update DistantContraptionManager to store and apply remote poses, expose pose freshness check to the renderer, and skip stale local snapshots. Add entity join/leave tracking and safe sampling. Adjust beacon beam width curve and LOD fade/contraption/beacon docs in README. Change config defaults (subDivisionSize -> 123, farPlayerAnimationDistance -> 0) and update config menu/NeoForge spec and language strings to reflect the new animation-distance semantics. Misc cleanup and snapshot lifecycle fixes across related classes.
